      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GETTING CHEEKY (2) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (17.12) at Murray Bridge. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Has good speed and a low draw is a big help. Better than last start and worth following up. THUNDER ROLLS (1) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at Gawler in a handy 23.21 beating Rafferty Blues. Has performed well from this box with a win and seven minor placings to his name from 12 starts. Should feature again. OUZO AND COKE (7) was in the money again last time and not beaten far when third (23.51) at Gawler in a Other. Has good speed and can quickly clear the pack out wide. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. ROYALE MAPLE (4) placed last start at this track and distance and is in the mix again.",
